## Install

### Linux (AppImage)

```bash
curl -fLO https://github.com/<OWNER>/<SLUG>/releases/latest/download/<SLUG>-x86_64.AppImage
chmod +x <SLUG>-x86_64.AppImage
./<SLUG>-x86_64.AppImage
```

If FUSE 2 is unavailable:

```bash
./<SLUG>-x86_64.AppImage --appimage-extract-and-run
```

### Linux (tarball)

```bash
curl -fLO https://github.com/<OWNER>/<SLUG>/releases/latest/download/<SLUG>-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
tar -xzf <SLUG>-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz
./<SLUG>/<SLUG>
```

### Windows / macOS

Download the archive for your platform from the
[releases page](https://github.com/<OWNER>/<SLUG>/releases) and extract it.

### From source

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<OWNER>/<SLUG>.git
cd <SLUG>
cargo run -p <SLUG> --release
```

## Usage

```bash
<SLUG>              # start with an empty document
<SLUG> --sample     # open the built-in demo document
<SLUG> --open FILE  # open a project file
```

